{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0216_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0216_story_04_title", "source_sha256": "8affb7d8549879732e2d5909d61888a488d06b39fe86be4b6cb5f20b717087f3", "ja": "窓の外に蠢くもの", "zh": "窗外蠢动之物", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0216_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0216_story_04_synopsis", "source_sha256": "2ba7215b7b4508614df44117641647cac87092bb669b99585f7d5620a8d2caae", "ja": "「厄災は終わらない」深淵海の言い残した\n言葉に怯え、人々は吹雪の中廃教会に集う。\n「私の神降ろしは失敗したのかな」と呟く\n永混。ふと夜中に目を覚ますと、そこには\n変わり果てた姿の人々と、凛音亞がいた。", "zh": "“灾祸尚未终结”——畏惧着深渊海留下的\n这句话，人们在暴风雪中聚集到废弃教会。\n“难道我的降神仪式失败了吗……”\n永混喃喃自语。半夜猛然醒来时，映入眼帘的\n却是模样彻底改变的人们，以及凛音亚的身影。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0216_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0216_story_04_1000_murabito", "source_sha256": "cc64a6c6b7bc69c1444ff4232f1b33f837b2f7abfc3336fcb04443758e56c55c", "ja": "『厄災』は終わらない……。\nあの学者先生が、そう言ったのか？", "zh": "“灾厄”不会结束……  \n是那位学者这么说的吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0216_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0216_story_04_1001_murabito", "source_sha256": "4f8194253aa70e9322914beb8243b05ab05a1e436edd0aa9f0086232af95c0fb", "ja": "一体どういう事だ？\n神降ろしの儀式は、成功したはずじゃ……。", "zh": "这到底是怎么回事？降神仪式明明应该成功了才对……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0216_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0216_story_04_1002_035hin", "source_sha256": "0b3861e8bde9cd81a83adcad3d73f219975ac4f4ac1b900eb93a1f8c2c7e4fc3", "ja": "わからない……。", "zh": "我不知道……。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0216_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0216_story_04_1003_murabito", "source_sha256": "09d9b3bd23f677d30748c6dbd016b22b1195661ae555cee1eccdccc40f2e477e", "ja": "わからないって、あんた村長だろう？", "zh": "你说不知道？你不是村长吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0216_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0216_story_04_1004_035hin", "source_sha256": "1dc44eca0bb6c0b5d780fac11605e19923b2a9284dc50bda5dc817ccfa9d63a3", "ja": "わからないものは、わからないんだ！\n……とにかく、お前達も村から出ない方がいい。", "zh": "不知道就是不知道啊！\n……总之，你们也最好不要离开村子。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0216_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0216_story_04_1005_035hin", "source_sha256": "e2edb7dfa4882d2b655d2dc41d353ea49e2d84b48e1103c1d701225e0377c952", "ja": "私は、『村長』だ。\n村の外の事までは……保証できない。", "zh": "我是“村长”。\n村子外面的事……我可保证不了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0216_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0216_story_04_1006_se", "source_sha256": "e2b679ed49b66f508294c1f48413d86b36bfd7fe992fd364ab6317491c4fef73", "ja": "バタン！", "zh": "砰！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0216_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0216_story_04_1007_039kon", "source_sha256": "9aa0e4c5894df1a44d21d43c122108d501b4a91be1b1d5db7c2c19e30577753c", "ja": "永混、少し吹雪いてきたわ。院に戻るより、\nみんなで集まっていたほうが安全かも……。", "zh": "嗯，外面渐渐下起暴风雪了。比起回院里，大家聚在一起可能更安全……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0216_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0216_story_04_1008_037nao", "source_sha256": "00183b298cf5f750faa716514d0450d466b0b170b7683325f8b92229c549de85", "ja": "そうだね。……廃教会に行こうか。\n他にも、人がいるかもしれないし。", "zh": "是啊。……我们去废弃教堂吧。\n说不定那里还有其他人。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0216_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0216_story_04_1009_murabito", "source_sha256": "3e9797035eb8a44998c4bc48ae38693ebe9599934979130c128d6d9f5e967494", "ja": "おい、もう少し詰めろよ。……ったく、\n『厄災』は終わったんじゃなかったのかよ……。", "zh": "喂，再挤紧一点。……真是的，“灾厄”不是已经结束了吗……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0216_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0216_story_04_1010_murabito", "source_sha256": "bf5ed8c1ce090bf7d36d5948c405326f42e359701dfc6d68a190839ede5d19aa", "ja": "いつまでこんな生活をしなきゃなんだろうな。\nここにある食い物だって、いつまでもつか……。", "zh": "这种生活到底还要持续到什么时候啊。\n这里的食物，也不知道还能撑多久……。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0216_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0216_story_04_1011_037nao", "source_sha256": "9effce0dc2dd26c307dceca94ab24d3b0f7c907af212a9b97a4fd48e42ac6372", "ja": "……。\n私の『神降ろし』は、失敗したのかな……。", "zh": "……。\n我的“请神仪式”，是失败了吗……。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0216_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0216_story_04_1012_039kon", "source_sha256": "38974a4b7cb2d33fdbaf53d81ade0acf1cad67cb26a63bcd7131361272d1febb", "ja": "あら、貴方が責任を感じる事なんてないわ、永混。\nだってそうでしょ？", "zh": "哎呀，你没必要觉得这是自己的责任哦，永混。\n毕竟事实就是如此吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0216_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0216_story_04_1013_039kon", "source_sha256": "28335e1e40c4ce76608f51f6e6e407f3619a93726162485b88e8009d8c0d68fe", "ja": "私が指名されても、それが貴方になっても。\n誰も、私達孤児の身代わりになろうとはしなかった。", "zh": "不管是我被点名，还是轮到你。\n没有人，愿意替我们这些孤儿去承担那一切。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0216_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0216_story_04_1015_037nao", "source_sha256": "1b5f6baaa00608658506ee18a815b50e209290ab3b6c9a113b217aaef41e1078", "ja": "それは……仕方ないよ。\nみんな、家族がいるんだし……。", "zh": "那是……没办法的事。大家都有家人嘛……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0216_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0216_story_04_1016_039kon", "source_sha256": "708becefce0bbad9c52790081f50c0f7212bdde16d6571b1843977f98ccfbe74", "ja": "いいえ、そんな事はないわ！　貴方は、皆のために\nその身を捧げたのよ？　讃えられる事はあっても……。", "zh": "不，才不是那样！你可是为了大家献出了自己啊？就算受到赞颂，也……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0216_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0216_story_04_1018_039kon", "source_sha256": "2df5728cb83dc7b72ec6bde931cf0d339b1f581c0dd8507cbc457ea13499c385", "ja": "逢路蘭？　邪魔をしないで……ヒッ！", "zh": "逢路兰？别碍事……嘶！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0216_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0216_story_04_1019_037nao", "source_sha256": "a8a62d0cf7487278ed71a09b6041020442891b134c7dc2b60fefd46152826caf", "ja": "凛音亞？", "zh": "凛音亚？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0216_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0216_story_04_1020_039kon", "source_sha256": "867a05cded1fe679df42e7f9e0681752ea3c4d160cfb186eeb935d880047b795", "ja": "ま、窓に……っ！", "zh": "窗、窗户上……！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0216_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0216_story_04_1021_039kon", "source_sha256": "b84e68c77c8c948efb84e8a44d009379df4477760ba11d4275f7e9c8105fd82a", "ja": "来たわ、来てしまったのよ！\n……『あれ』が！", "zh": "来了，还是来了！\n……『那东西』！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0216_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0216_story_04_1022_se", "source_sha256": "a718d1f997b3ddc7978aa8949f89a75462c3453c88e940871eb0fa7448e1f381", "ja": "ガチャガチャ……バタン！", "zh": "咔嚓咔嚓……砰！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0216_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0216_story_04_1023_035hin", "source_sha256": "45aff9e8e328ae2eef679d019abdbc63597d477a501d6598f173f16a80ac5bff", "ja": "凛音亞！", "zh": "凛音亚！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0216_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0216_story_04_1024_037nao", "source_sha256": "99337541d04d490c6fdf30b725580be437ea5a8b6f712df87671f84f66b22a9e", "ja": "夜羽那お嬢さん？　どうしてここへ……。", "zh": "夜羽那大小姐？你怎么来这里了……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0216_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0216_story_04_1025_035hin", "source_sha256": "39677a2010f80095d4663db91829c65833e8e36b7242903ea6363fb45f5797c3", "ja": "大丈夫、私達は大丈夫だ、凛音亞！\nだって、儀式は成功したんだから……！", "zh": "没事的，我们没事的，凛音亚！\n因为，仪式已经成功了啊……！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0216_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0216_story_04_1026_039kon", "source_sha256": "1c5f0692fd91cb03ded8883ce01f126aafb9fa80fdba76ece94242954ebddda3", "ja": "いや！　……触らないで！", "zh": "不要！……别碰我！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0216_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0216_story_04_1027_039kon", "source_sha256": "783b71ad2fc8fdcf2e9043156e0d89da680674e063b6f45c8cf1ae095b4507fd", "ja": "欺瞞だわ！　どうせみんな死ぬのよ！\n何も知らずに……ああ、なんて気の毒な人たち！", "zh": "这是欺骗！反正大家都会死的！\n什么都不知道……啊，多么可怜的人们啊！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0216_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0216_story_04_1028_035hin", "source_sha256": "6740661fbdca943fa8f27b6b80f9b4e793215dc0ec849a09df759f0596aa1ce6", "ja": "凛音亞！　……そこのお前、医者だったな。\n鎮静剤はあるか！？", "zh": "凛音亞！……那边那个，你是医生吧。有没有镇静剂！？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0216_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0216_story_04_1029_isha", "source_sha256": "74f5c3c7c10c57771fd2a8a435be5b388e6ddd6693feb8a793fdd47bb012db32", "ja": "は、はいっ！", "zh": "好、好的！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0216_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0216_story_04_1030_035hin", "source_sha256": "993f0ac09b834854517b5c327a20567c03325adb235149317342a5b251147eef", "ja": "……眠ったな。凛音亞はきっと、\n怯えてしまったのだろう。可哀想に。", "zh": "……睡着了啊。凛音亚肯定是吓到了吧。真可怜。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0216_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0216_story_04_1031_037nao", "source_sha256": "ccb371162c74e1b02528a897d763146c4ee7b5faf4aaeea6602cf69c8fcf7f63", "ja": "あの、夜羽那お嬢さん。\nさっきのは、どういう……。", "zh": "那个，夜羽那小姐。\n刚才那是怎么一回事……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0216_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0216_story_04_1032_035hin", "source_sha256": "328b81df2353ccd4452e44b567a393fab670ef05a1f99d36992a44c9cd8ca30c", "ja": "すまないが、疲れているんだ。\n……またにしてくれないか。", "zh": "抱歉，我累了。\n……能改天再说吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0216_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0216_story_04_1034_037nao", "source_sha256": "cd5b5ce138e23c5af696ead64c5eab850b16589c3ddd36c320452fcbba16c31d", "ja": "逢路蘭……うん、そうだね。\n私達も、眠ろうか……。", "zh": "逢路兰……嗯，是啊。我们也睡吧……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0216_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0216_story_04_1037_037nao", "source_sha256": "033c7d5dc2c2a00608fe7f9408f5f25e99ba02ceee18bfdce0b4841a0484bec9", "ja": "（近くに、誰かいる……あれは……）", "zh": "（附近有人……那是……）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0216_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0216_story_04_1038_037nao", "source_sha256": "3fdef004123a99c32ec6f0647113b0df66a8c4c1e6d20a5cc1e9db257a888fcb", "ja": "……凛音亞……？", "zh": "……凛音亚……？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0216_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0216_story_04_1039_039kon", "source_sha256": "d4d3b9ae6a2fac95b1800e63b8a927012e6d1eb1e93cdae84c1b242918f211b5", "ja": "……この子が悪いのよ。", "zh": "……都是这孩子的错。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0216_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0216_story_04_1040_se", "source_sha256": "d0dfb3aa0e85eca8bc767ffe07ebdee089a68c61b786298689cddaf88c9ca1e1", "ja": "ガタッ……", "zh": "咔哒……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0216_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0216_story_04_1041_037nao", "source_sha256": "bb1bc5986e5b6d3f32fe58c02ffd1b2d78cf2df332649e324bd0b4378bcb483a", "ja": "え……。", "zh": "咦……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0216_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0216_story_04_1042_039kon", "source_sha256": "8006bb9819106a4e8d2af65e5f48d09254b84b9587f84e28ef26088f7f4beac1", "ja": "どうして私が生贄にならなくちゃならないの！？\n私でいいなら、この子だっていいはずだわ！", "zh": "为什么我非得成为祭品不可！？\n如果我可以的话，那这个孩子也应该可以吧！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0216_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0216_story_04_1043_037nao", "source_sha256": "db6828230378a8fdc023755872e0955e85891d37ff64e25c13ccf7a671762e3f", "ja": "ど、どうして……みんな、起きてくれ！\n夜羽那お嬢さん！　……なあ、嘘だろう！？", "zh": "怎、怎么会……大家，快醒醒啊！  \n夜羽那小姐！……喂，不会是真的吧！？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0216_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0216_story_04_1044_039kon", "source_sha256": "fe286c63e28f8c4376e35f7a3f02a8ac5fc377eea83a97b6f5493275d19a91c2", "ja": "大丈夫よ、永混。\n貴方ひとりを、置いていったりしないから……。", "zh": "没事的，永混。\n我不会留下你一个人的……。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0216_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0216_story_04_1045_037nao", "source_sha256": "83b062b2500bbbc51e76b1a8415177bc029eccff3d4e03d136775c6936512d30", "ja": "凛音亞！\n……いやああああああ！！！", "zh": "凛音亚！\n……不要啊啊啊啊啊啊！！！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0216_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0216_story_04_1047_037nao", "source_sha256": "9c29386099e7e9c0fcee1c827c74438123c33986c38cb8b881ef91fec79c012c", "ja": "どうして……どうしていつも、こんな事に……。\nいつも……。全部、私のせいだ……私が……。", "zh": "为什么……为什么总是会变成这样……。\n总是……全都是我的错……都是我……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0216_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0216_story_04_1048_040tam", "source_sha256": "f0bdcf5c4d4f604519c4a137209ac95c15663a27917fcc0ed96d4f731831e024", "ja": "やれやれ。ほんと、懲りないよね。", "zh": "哎呀哎呀。你真是不知道吸取教训呢。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0216_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0216_story_04_1049_037nao", "source_sha256": "4154ad764aa774c382e7d866058518d77a0394b1d90431b127e653aa10c3d5a0", "ja": "逢路蘭……？", "zh": "逢路兰……？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
